; Test 08: loadxtra/savextra.  A CD source with its own .xtra, SAVE under
; a new name; let2.bb2.xtra must equal let.bb2.xtra (checked on the host),
; let2.bb2 = let.bb2.  TED prefills the file gadget with the FULL name
; (TEDRUN:work/let.bb2, PATH: empty) - a bare "let2.bb2" was saved relative
; to the current directory (sessions F/H), so the full name is given.
; @source K internet/manual_source/blitz_manual/02.variable_handling/let.bb2
; @est 3
; @expect cd let2.bb2 internet/manual_source/blitz_manual/02.variable_handling/let.bb2
; @expect exists let2.bb2.xtra
; @expect exists let2.bb2.info
; @expect same let.bb2
timeout 10
wait req "OKEE DOKEE"
gad 1
wait screen
menu 0 2
wait freq "Name to save file as"
freq ok "TEDRUN:work/let2.bb2"
wait screen
dump saved
menu 0 9
wait exit
